# MANDIBLES: a red soldier that picks a target locks its spit direction and
# keeps spitting that way until the target dies or leaves its range. Step
# off its line and it spits at nothing; stand at an angle it isn't facing
# and you can hit it without being hit.
game mandibles
wait 5
cheat mission 1 17
cheat clear
cheat red_store 0
cheat store 1
cheat mistakes 0
cheat at 160 60
cheat unit 3 1 200 60
wait 12
expect t0_lock == 4
# out of its line, still in range: it keeps spitting west
hold UP 40
expect t0_lock == 4
expect py <= 42
hold RIGHT 60
expect t0_lock == 4
# now diagonal to it (north-west of it): face south-east and spit
press DOWN+RIGHT 1
cheat at 182 42
hold B 200
expect t0_alive == 0
expect hp >= 2
